content.text:
Before I answer, I'm checking three things that decide whether "videos hosted elsewhere" would add delay:
- how the backend serves video today (whether it supports seeking via partial requests);
- how the frontend consumes it (the cookie login requires the video URL to stay on your own domain);
- how much free space the usual video hosts give compared with the server's own disk.
